{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "ACRODRIFT: FPV Drone Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3698490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Acrodrift: FPV Drone Simulator</strong>\u00a0- your launchpad into the electrifying world of first-person drone flight. Designed for both aspiring pilots and seasoned FPV pros, Acrodrift delivers realistic flight physics and immersive gameplay. Whether you\u2019re chasing the thrill of competition or perfecting a smooth freestyle line through tight spaces, this simulator is your aerial playground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE CONTROLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And no matter your setup, Acrodrift adapts to your style. <strong>Fly using a gamepad, connect a professional FPV radio controller for authentic handling. </strong>The game supports a wide range of devices and lets you remap every axis to suit your preference.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLIGHT MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with <strong>Free Flight Mode</strong> to get a feel for your drone and unleash your creativity as you weave between obstacles and try out gravity-defying stunts. Want a challenge? <strong>Race Mode</strong> pushes your reflexes to the edge with checkpoint circuits that test your timing and control. More fun-focused? A <strong>balloon-popping collection mode</strong> is coming soon to add a twist to your training.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRONE WORKSHOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your perfect flight machine in the <strong>Drone Workshop</strong>\u00a0- customize frames, tweak components, and fine-tune PID settings just like in real FPV gear. Prefer plug-and-play? Prebuilt drones let you dive in without setup worries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic FPV flight</strong> with advanced drone physics and customizable PID tuning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple gameplay modes</strong>: Free Flight, Time Trial Races, and a fun collectible mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drone customization</strong>: Build from scratch or choose ready-made models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller support</strong>: Use gamepads or connect your FPV radio controller for full immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful environments in various locations: forests, mountains, harbours, cities!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're training for real-world races or just love the thrill of virtual acro, <strong>Acrodrift</strong> is your ticket to sky-high adrenaline.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Acrodrift: FPV Drone Simulator</strong>\u00a0- your launchpad into the electrifying world of first-person drone flight. Designed for both aspiring pilots and seasoned FPV pros, Acrodrift delivers realistic flight physics and immersive gameplay. Whether you\u2019re chasing the thrill of competition or perfecting a smooth freestyle line through tight spaces, this simulator is your aerial playground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE CONTROLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And no matter your setup, Acrodrift adapts to your style. <strong>Fly using a gamepad, connect a professional FPV radio controller for authentic handling. </strong>The game supports a wide range of devices and lets you remap every axis to suit your preference.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLIGHT MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with <strong>Free Flight Mode</strong> to get a feel for your drone and unleash your creativity as you weave between obstacles and try out gravity-defying stunts. Want a challenge? <strong>Race Mode</strong> pushes your reflexes to the edge with checkpoint circuits that test your timing and control. More fun-focused? A <strong>balloon-popping collection mode</strong> is coming soon to add a twist to your training.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRONE WORKSHOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your perfect flight machine in the <strong>Drone Workshop</strong>\u00a0- customize frames, tweak components, and fine-tune PID settings just like in real FPV gear. Prefer plug-and-play? Prebuilt drones let you dive in without setup worries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic FPV flight</strong> with advanced drone physics and customizable PID tuning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple gameplay modes</strong>: Free Flight, Time Trial Races, and a fun collectible mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drone customization</strong>: Build from scratch or choose ready-made models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller support</strong>: Use gamepads or connect your FPV radio controller for full immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful environments in various locations: forests, mountains, harbours, cities!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're training for real-world races or just love the thrill of virtual acro, <strong>Acrodrift</strong> is your ticket to sky-high adrenaline.</p>",
    "short_description": "A high-speed FPV drone simulator that challenges your skills with precision flying, time attack races, and freestyle exploration. Customize your drone, tune flight dynamics, and master the art of acro flying across immersive environments.",
